<title>BELGIUM: EU cereals experts to decide Greek maize tender.</title>
<headline>EU cereals experts to decide Greek maize tender.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's cereals management committee will on Thursday open a special measure export tender for 100,000 tonnes of maize from northern Greece, an EU official said.</p>
<p>&quot;The committee is expected to decide this item left over from the previous week and it will also open two annual tenders for manioc from Thailand and from other third countries as well as for sweet potatoes and for manioc starch,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>--Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
